"/arc-plc/arkansas/white-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the White County record runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 10 grids, October to November came in under 90% of normal in 38 of those years. In 2025 the middle got 54% of normal in October to November and 20% in November to December. So far in 2026 it was 54% in January to February and 51% in February to March.</p>"}
